        अपूर्णगणनाकोश अङ्कः हेतुः अन्तः भवति ० ।
        हेतुः भवति हेतुः योगः १ ।
    इति
    ॰ `W-301`: the SITE census starts at zero too, and is sized by this same write.
    ॰ The bound is EXCLUSIVE and the loop does not restate it, matching the reset
    ॰ above after `1cc531bd`. A second convention inside one reset is how `सीमा`
    ॰ produced two silent defects in 24 hours on 2026-09-16/17.
    चरः स्थलाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति १ ।
