                ॰ the ० of its declaration and the call below was appended with
                ॰ `संज्ञा ०`. `यन्त्रनामान्वेषणम् ०` misses — there is no symbol ० —
                ॰ and `यन्त्राह्वानोत्सर्जनम्` refuses the whole module with
