                    इति
                इति
            इति
        इति

        ॰ BOTH OPERANDS ARE LOWERED LAST, after every refusal has had its
        ॰ chance, so a residue path emits no instructions at all — the `क्षेत्र`
        ॰ and `W-278` arms give the reason: dead instructions on a refused path
        ॰ inflate the shape counts and make a stub look like work.
        चरः आधारफलम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति अभिव्यञ्जकरचना आधारसूचकाङ्क ।
