        चरः विस्तारफलम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति नवमूल्यम् ० ।
        ॰ `W-294` — THE SCALE IS THE ELEMENT'S OWN WIDTH, not the literal ८ that
        ॰ stood here. For a run of words it still answers ८ and every existing
        ॰ image is octet-identical; only the widths this arm used to refuse reach
        ॰ a different number.
