            चरः अवगणनफलदैर्घ्य ॱॱ न६४ भवति आज्ञायोजनम् आरभ्य योगाज्ञाभेद ऽ फलदैर्घ्यम् ऽ ० ऽ ० ऽ पूर्वदैर्घ्यम् ऽ वृद्धिः ऽ ० समाप्तम् ।
            चरः शीर्षनिधानम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति नवमूल्यम् ० ।
            चरः अवगणनशीर्षनिधानम् ॱॱ न६४ भवति आज्ञायोजनम् आरभ्य स्थाननिधानाज्ञाभेद ऽ शीर्षनिधानम् ऽ ० ऽ ० ऽ शीर्षस्थानम् ऽ फलदैर्घ्यम् ऽ ० समाप्तम् ।
        इति अन्यथा आदि
            ॰ `W-294` — THE WIDTH TRAVELS IN `ध्रुवमूल्यम्`, and this kind now
            ॰ carries a constant where its emitter's margin said it carried none.
            ॰ The emitter needs the width to pick the load: `आहारः` is the ६४-bit
            ॰ form and a one-octet element wants `आहारःॱअ८`. `ध्रुवमूल्यम्` is the
            ॰ channel the `क्षेत्र` arm already uses for exactly this reason — it
            ॰ is the instruction's `अ६४` constant, and NOT `स्थानक्रम`, which the
            ॰ frame-sizing pass reads and would misread as a local count.
            ॰
            ॰ THE ADDRESS KIND ABOVE KEEPS ० DELIBERATELY: it forms an address and
            ॰ performs no load, so it has no width to pick. Its scaling is already
            ॰ correct through `अन्तरफलम्`.
            सूचीफलान्तिमम् भवति सुरक्षितसूचीरचना आरभ्य आधारफलम् ऽ अन्तरफलम् ऽ अष्टकविस्तार समाप्तम् ।
            ॰ shape २८ — a NEW number, for the reason its declaration carries.
            रचितगणनम् २८ ।
        इति
        प्रत्यागमनम् सूचीफलान्तिमम् ।
    इति
    ॰ Expression::Field — `वस्तु ॱ क्षेत्रम्`, lowered to `LoadField(base, offset)`.
    ॰
    ॰ THE OFFSET IS `WORD × THE FIELD'S DECLARATION INDEX`, the owner's data-model
    ॰ ruling, and it is carried in `ध्रुवमूल्यम्` — the instruction's `अ६४`
    ॰ constant — and NEVER in `स्थानक्रम`. That is not a style choice: the
    ॰ frame-sizing pass takes `स्थानीयाः = max(स्थानीयाः, स्थानक्रम + १)`, so a
    ॰ byte offset parked there would claim seventeen locals for a field at byte
    ॰ १६, AND `यन्त्रचौकटम्` scales `स्थानक्रम` by ८ a second time. Wrong twice
    ॰ and loudly in neither. The kind dispatch is what actually protects it —
    ॰ `स्थानवत्` is set true ONLY for `आहाराज्ञाभेद` and `निधानाज्ञाभेद`, so a new
    ॰ kind is skipped by construction rather than by anyone remembering.
    ॰
    ॰ THE WALK IS PORTED FROM THE CHECKER'S OWN FIELD ARM, guard for guard, and
    ॰ deliberately so: the two halves then refuse the SAME set for the SAME
    ॰ reasons, by construction rather than by my judgement. A lowering that
    ॰ quietly succeeds where the checker refuses is a silent miscompile, and it
    ॰ looks exactly like a better census number. `artha.t1`'s arm computes this
    ॰ very index as `क्षेत्रक्रमः` and DISCARDS it, answering the field's type;
    ॰ recording it there would delete this walk, and that is a one-line change to
    ॰ a file this row does not own. Named here so whoever sequences it later
    ॰ knows precisely what it replaces.
    ॰
    ॰ EVERY ARENA READ IS LENGTH-GUARDED AND EVERY VALUE HOLE-GUARDED BEFORE
    ॰ ARITHMETIC. `संज्ञाघोषणाकोश` and `संज्ञाभेदकोश` have ONE writer each where
    ॰ the type arena has two, so those two carry `शून्यम्` holes; and equality
    ॰ does not typecheck its operands, so `समम् ०` against a hole answers FALSE
    ॰ IN SILENCE while `योगः १` on the same hole raises "expected a number".
    ॰ The quiet one is the one that ships, which is why the guard is on the value
    ॰ and not only on the length.
    ॰
    ॰ THE RESIDUE IS CAUSE २५ AND IT IS TWO POPULATIONS, NOT ONE — the report
    ॰ must split them. Sites the CORPUS cannot lower: a base whose struct
    ॰ declaration is not reachable, which is what the checker's four guards
    ॰ already refuse. Sites THIS IMPLEMENTATION declines: a base that is not a
    ॰ plain name, which makes `a ॱ b ॱ c` residue by my choice and not by the
    ॰ corpus's shape. A residue I create is not a residue I found.
    यदि अभि ॱ भेद समम् वास्तुॱक्षेत्राभिव्यञ्जकभेद आदि
        चरः वस्तुसूचकाङ्क ॱॱ न६४ भवति अभि ॱ वामसूचकाङ्क ।
        यदि वस्तुसूचकाङ्क समम् ० आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ४० । इति
        यदि वास्तुॱअभिव्यञ्जककोश ॱ दैर्घ्य न्यूनम् वस्तुसूचकाङ्क योगः १ आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ४१ । इति
        चरः वस्तुअभि ॱॱ वास्तुॱअभिव्यञ्जक भवति वास्तुॱअभिव्यञ्जककोश अङ्कः वस्तुसूचकाङ्क अन्तः ।
        यदि वस्तुअभि समम् शून्यम् आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ४२ । इति

        ॰ MY RESTRICTION, not the corpus's: the base must be a plain name. A
        ॰ folded qualified name carries its member in `दक्षिण` and denotes a
        ॰ MODULE, which has no fields and no declaration to index.
        ॰ CAUSE २६ AND NOT २५, AND THE DISTINCTION IS THE WHOLE POINT OF THE
        ॰ SPLIT: this is the ONE refusal in this arm that is a SCOPE DECISION
        ॰ rather than a fact about the tree. The base could be lowered — it is a
        ॰ record expression like any other — and this arm declines it because it
        ॰ handles only a plain name. Relaxing it is a change to THIS FILE and
        ॰ nothing else, which is exactly what makes it the owner's to overturn.
        ॰ Cause २५ below is the opposite: a declaration that cannot be reached
        ॰ is a property of the corpus and no edit here would recover it.
        ॰ A residue I create is not a residue I found, and one number covering
        ॰ both would have credited this row with the smaller of the two.
        ॰ ॥ THE BASE NEED NOT BE A PLAIN NAME ॥ Cause २६ was a SCOPE refusal and
        ॰ this arm's own margin said so: "MY RESTRICTION, not the corpus's… The base
        ॰ could be lowered — it is a record expression like any other… Relaxing it is
        ॰ a change to THIS FILE and nothing else." Overturned by the owner.
        ॰
        ॰ A NAME BASE KEEPS ITS PATH UNCHANGED, and that is deliberate: it carries
        ॰ causes ४३, २८, २९ and ३० as named diagnostics, and routing it through the
        ॰ typer would take four numbers to zero that are nothing to do with this unit.
        ॰ Only the ELSE arm is new.
        ॰
        ॰ `अर्थॱअभिव्यञ्जकप्रकारः` is `सार्वजनिक`, types ten expression kinds including
        ॰ `क्षेत्र`, and `ir.t1` called it ZERO times before this. The dominant shape is
        ॰ `a ॱ b ॱ c` — 146 of the 148 non-name bases in the corpus.
        ॰
        ॰ THIS LOWERS NOTHING, AND THE MEASUREMENT SAYS SO. On `artha.t1`, through
        ॰ the CENSUS path: cause २६ 9 → 0, cause ३२ 135 → 144, `field_load` 41 → 41,
        ॰ total stubs 274 → 274. The nine move one guard along and the sum is
        ॰ conserved. **Cause २६ was cause ३२ wearing a scope restriction.**
        ॰
        ॰ The base types fine and then fails `भेद असमम् संरचनार्थभेद`, because
        ॰ `परिसरः ॱ प्रविष्टयः` is a RUN and `ॱ दैर्घ्य` on a run is cause ३२'s own
        ॰ population — the run-representation unit. Removing the restriction did not
        ॰ unblock the sites; it revealed which blocker they were really behind, and
        ॰ made that population nine larger and honestly sized for its owner.
        ॰
        ॰ Predicted before the run: "`field_load` rises by the same number." It did
        ॰ not move at all. The conservation check is what caught it.
        चरः वस्तुप्रकारः ॱॱ अर्थॱअर्थप्रकार भवति ० ।
        यदि वस्तुअभि ॱ भेद समम् वास्तुॱनामाभिव्यञ्जकभेद आदि
            यदि वस्तुअभि ॱ दक्षिणसूचकाङ्क अधिकम् ० आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ४३ । इति
            चरः वस्तुसंज्ञा ॱॱ न६४ भवति वस्तुअभि ॱ संज्ञासूचकाङ्क ।
            यदि वस्तुसंज्ञा समम् ० आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् २८ । इति

            ॰ the base's TYPE, reached the way the `W-278` global arm reaches one —
            ॰ through arenas `ir.t1` already reads, and NOT by calling an `अर्थ`
            ॰ routine, which this file has never done and which is not this row's
            ॰ risk to take.
            चरः प्रकारसूचकः ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।
            यदि वस्तुसंज्ञा न्यूनम् अर्थॱसंज्ञाप्रकारकोश ॱ दैर्घ्य आदि
                प्रकारसूचकः भवति अर्थॱसंज्ञाप्रकारकोश अङ्कः वस्तुसंज्ञा अन्तः ।
                यदि प्रकारसूचकः असमम् ० आदि
                    यदि प्रकारसूचकः समम् शून्यम् आदि
                        प्रकारसूचकः भवति ० ।
                    इति
                इति
            इति
            यदि प्रकारसूचकः समम् ० आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् २९ । इति
            यदि अर्थॱअर्थप्रकारकोश ॱ दैर्घ्य न्यूनम् प्रकारसूचकः योगः १ आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ३० । इति
            वस्तुप्रकारः भवति अर्थॱअर्थप्रकारकोश अङ्कः प्रकारसूचकः अन्तः ।
        इति अन्यथा आदि
            वस्तुप्रकारः भवति अर्थॱअभिव्यञ्जकप्रकारः वास्तुॱअभिव्यञ्जककोश वस्तुसूचकाङ्क ।
        इति
        ॰ AN OPTIONAL RECORD IS ITS RECORD (2026-09-22). `सम्भाव्य R` is one word
        ॰ natively — the record's pointer, ० for absent — so a field of it is a field of
        ॰ R. With no unwrap here, a field read through `सम्भाव्य` typed as the poison and
        ॰ lowered as a constant ०: the linker's decoded instruction name
        ॰ (`विश्लिष्टः ॱ आज्ञा`, `samyojana.t1` `संस्कारः`) was empty natively, every
        ॰ relocation patch refused "no 32-bit encoding", and the native self-image build
        ॰ answered no image. Measured: a plain record's fields read 97 = 97 natively,
        ॰ the same record through `सम्भाव्य` read 0 against the interpreter's 97.
        यदि वस्तुप्रकारः असमम् शून्यम् आदि
            यदि वस्तुप्रकारः ॱ भेद समम् अर्थॱसम्भाव्यार्थभेद आदि
                चरः अन्तर्गतप्रकारः ॱॱ न६४ भवति वस्तुप्रकारः ॱ अन्तःसूचकाङ्क ।
                यदि अन्तर्गतप्रकारः अधिकम् ० आदि
                    यदि अन्तर्गतप्रकारः न्यूनम् अर्थॱअर्थप्रकारकोश ॱ दैर्घ्य आदि
                        वस्तुप्रकारः भवति अर्थॱअर्थप्रकारकोश अङ्कः अन्तर्गतप्रकारः अन्तः ।
                    इति
                इति
            इति
        इति
        यदि वस्तुप्रकारः समम् शून्यम् आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ३१ । इति
        ॰ `W-len` — `ॱ दैर्घ्य` ON A RUN IS A LOAD OF ITS HEADER WORD, and there
        ॰ is NO local/global/parameter guard here. That absence IS the design's
        ॰ test: a run's base is formed in exactly three places — local
        ॰ allocation, bss global, rodata literal — and all three now lay a
        ॰ header at `आधार वियोगः ८`, so a pointer has one below it whatever its
        ॰ provenance. A record field or an arena element holding a run holds a
        ॰ POINTER (`:2683`/`:2685` size a record as field COUNT × ८, one word
        ॰ per field), so the header travels with it.
        ॰
        ॰ THE FIRST VERSION OF THIS ARM HAD A GUARD AND WAS UNSOUND. It admitted
        ॰ any base whose NAME was in the local table — and a PARAMETER is in the
        ॰ local table, so it read `base − ८` on a pointer the CALLER supplied,
        ॰ which under a locals-only header is a literal or a global with nothing
        ॰ below it. १४३ of the classifiable length reads are parameters against
        ॰ ३८ true locals. A guard cannot rescue this; only universality can, and
        ॰ if one is ever needed again some base is being formed without a header.
        ॰
        ॰ `ध्रुवमूल्यम्` LEFT AT ० ON THE LOAD, so it takes the ६४-bit default.
        ॰ `W-narrow` made that field the element WIDTH for the index kind, but a
        ॰ COUNT is a word whatever the elements are — the one place where not
        ॰ inheriting the stride is correct.
        यदि वस्तुप्रकारः ॱ भेद समम् अर्थॱखण्डार्थभेद आदि
            यदि अभि ॱ मूल्यसूचकाङ्क अधिकम् ० आदि
                यदि पदविभागॱचिह्नककोश ॱ दैर्घ्य बृहत्समम् अभि ॱ मूल्यसूचकाङ्क आदि
                    चरः दैर्घ्यचिह्नकम् ॱॱ पदविभागॱचिह्नक भवति पदविभागॱचिह्नककोश अङ्कः आरभ्य अभि ॱ मूल्यसूचकाङ्क वियोगः १ समाप्तम् अन्तः ।
                    चरः दैर्घ्यक्षेत्रपाठ ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ भवति पदविभागॱचिह्नकपाठः दैर्घ्यचिह्नकम् ।
                    यदि दैर्घ्यक्षेत्रपाठ समम् आरभ्य उक्तम् दैर्घ्य इति समाप्तम् आदि
                        चरः धारकफलम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति अभिव्यञ्जकरचना वस्तुसूचकाङ्क ।
                        ॰ ० for a nil run (2026-09-13): a record's run field before its first store.
                        चरः दैर्घ्यफलम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति खण्डदैर्घ्यरचना आरभ्य धारकफलम् ऽ खण्डविस्तारः वस्तुप्रकारः समाप्तम् ।
                        रचितगणनम् ३४ ।
                        प्रत्यागमनम् दैर्घ्यफलम् ।
                    इति
                इति
            इति
        इति
        ॰ ॥ CAUSE ३२ WAS 92% ONE THING AND ITS NAME SAID ANOTHER ॥ `W-283`, 2026-09-27.
        ॰
        ॰ `field_qualified_type_not_struct` reads as a CORPUS FACT — the source asks
        ॰ for a field of something that is not a record — and cause २५'s margin above
        ॰ says exactly that: "no edit to `ir.t1` recovers these". MEASURED, and the
        ॰ reading is wrong for almost all of it. The base's recorded type is the
        ॰ CHECKER'S POISON (`अर्थॱदोषार्थः`, `Ty::Error`), which is not a type the
        ॰ corpus wrote: it is `अर्थ` declining to type the declaration at all.
        ॰
        ॰ MEASURED BEFORE IT WAS BELIEVED, `T1_CORPUS=ir,encode` through the census,
        ॰ by a throwaway probe that routed each of the eleven possible kinds onto a
        ॰ cause measured zero on that set — so the split is read off the counter and
        ॰ not off a reading of the corpus:
        ॰
        ॰                                    HEAD    probe   this tree
        ॰     ३२ field_qualified_type_not_struct   399      41      41
        ॰     ४५ field_qualified_type_is_poison      —     369     359
        ॰        paradigm_ir_stubs                 671     682     673
        ॰
        ॰ AND THE PROBE'S ३६९ IS NOT THE POPULATION — ELEVEN OF THEM WERE THE PROBE.
        ॰ `ir.t1` is itself one of the two sources being compiled, so the probe's own
        ॰ eleven `वस्तुप्रकारः ॱ भेद` reads were compiled and counted, and every one of
        ॰ them landed in the SAME population: ४१ + ३६९ = ३९९ + ११, so the standing
        ॰ population is ३५८ and this landing's single guard line makes it ३५९.
        ॰
        ॰ THAT ३५९ AND THAT ४१ WERE PREDICTED BEFORE THE RUN AND BOTH ANSWERED EXACTLY.
        ॰ The total did not: predicted ६७२, measured ६७३, and the extra one is the same
        ॰ self-measurement in a second place — the guard names `अर्थॱदोषार्थभेद`, a
        ॰ module-qualified read this file lowers as cause १, which went १३२ -> १३३. A
        ॰ prediction that gets the two split numbers right and the sum wrong by one is
        ॰ worth more than a round one: it says the split is exact and the instrument
        ॰ still sees its own edits.
        ॰
        ॰ WHICH MAKES THIS AN `अर्थ` GAP AND NOT A LOWERING ONE, and the counter now
        ॰ says so. A local declared `ॱॱ <मण्डल>ॱ<संरचना>` — the dominant shape in both
        ॰ files — takes `अर्थॱप्रकारार्थः` -> `मूलप्रकारार्थः` (no primitive spelling) ->
        ॰ `नामप्रकारार्थः`, which either resolves the qualified name through the store or
        ॰ REFUSES BY NAME with one of five reasons it already records
        ॰ (`अज्ञातप्रकारपाठकोश` beside `अज्ञातप्रकारकारणकोश`, artha.t1:219-225). No arm
        ॰ here can recover a type that was never computed; reading the refusal record is
        ॰ the next unit, and it needs no new instrument.
        ॰
        ॰ THE CASE THAT MUST STILL BE REFUSED AS ३२ IS THE ४१, and it is a MEASUREMENT
        ॰ and not a hope: a base whose type is real and is not a record — an integer, a
        ॰ run with a field that is not `दैर्घ्य`, an enum — still answers ३२ here, and a
        ॰ split that had emptied ३२ would have proved only that the new guard swallowed
        ॰ the arm. Both populations are non-zero on the same run.
        यदि वस्तुप्रकारः ॱ भेद समम् अर्थॱदोषार्थभेद आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ४५ । इति
        यदि वस्तुप्रकारः ॱ भेद असमम् अर्थॱसंरचनार्थभेद आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ३२ । इति
        चरः रचनासंज्ञा ॱॱ न६४ भवति वस्तुप्रकारः ॱ संज्ञा ।
        यदि रचनासंज्ञा समम् ० आदि प्रत्यागमनम् अपूर्णध्रुवम् ३३ । इति

        ॰ struct symbol -> its declaration. THIS is where a cross-module struct
        ॰ falls out: `सञ्चयसंज्ञा` mints a symbol for a cross-module member and
        ॰ writes only the arenas keyed by SymbolId — it is deliberately NOT
        ॰ `घोषणम्`, so there is no declaration here to reach.
