        ॰ is declared inside the `वामसूचकाङ्क अधिकम् ०` block below, so its symbol
        ॰ is out of scope where the global store is attempted. Reading it there
        ॰ instead would have wanted the expression arena a second time.
        चरः लक्ष्यसंज्ञा ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।
