                                        ॰ `दक्षिण`, and the order is not
                                        ॰ recoverable downstream: both are live
                                        ॰ words, so a swap writes the address
                                        ॰ into the value's storage and nothing
                                        ॰ refuses it. All four decode tables read
                                        ॰ them in this order.
