                                        ॰ reading what `रचितगणनम्` RAISES rather
                                        ॰ than what the table declares. ११..२५
                                        ॰ are computed as `१० + द्विकर्म` at
                                        ॰ `:1123` and no literal raise exists for
                                        ॰ any of them, so a grep for literals
                                        ॰ finds nine sites and misses fifteen
