            ॰ CLEARED AGAIN HERE, AND NOT ONLY AT THE BUILDER'S HEAD. The head
            ॰ clears it on every call INCLUDING the refusing ones, so this is
            ॰ belt and braces — but a future arm that sets the flag and then
            ॰ returns before calling the builder would leak it, and this line
            ॰ costs nothing.
            स्थानमात्रम् भवति असत्यम् ।
