            ॰ THE INDEX IS LOWERED ONCE (2026-09-13): after growth the address is formed
            ॰ from the reloaded base and the index value already in hand — re-lowering
            ॰ `x अङ्कः x ॱ दैर्घ्य अन्तः` after the length bump landed every append one
            ॰ past its slot, and an assembled source came out twice its length.
            चरः सूचीस्थानफलम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति नवमूल्यम् ० ।
            यदि वृद्धिविस्तार अधिकम् ० आदि
                चरः पुनराधारः ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति अभिव्यञ्जकरचना सूचीलक्ष्यम् ॱ वामसूचकाङ्क ।
                चरः सूचीविस्तारमूल्यम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति ध्रुवरचना वृद्धिविस्तार ।
                चरः सूच्यन्तरम् ॱॱ मूल्याङ्क भवति द्विकर्मरचना आरभ्य गुणनाज्ञाभेद ऽ वृद्धिसूचकः ऽ सूचीविस्तारमूल्यम् समाप्तम् ।
                चरः अवगणनसूचीस्थान ॱॱ न६४ भवति आज्ञायोजनम् आरभ्य सूचीस्थानाज्ञाभेद ऽ सूचीस्थानफलम् ऽ ० ऽ ० ऽ पुनराधारः ऽ सूच्यन्तरम् ऽ ० समाप्तम् ।
                ॰ `W-306` — ३५ AND NOT ३२, AND THE MEASUREMENT IS WHY. This branch
                ॰ builds `सूचीस्थानाज्ञाभेद` INLINE and used to count NOTHING, so the
                ॰ whole corpus lowered its indexed writes here and `रचितगणनम् ३२` at
                ॰ `:3332` read a truthful, well-formed ZERO — which six readings took
                ॰ for a lowering regression. `GrowthOnly` over nine modules settled it:
                ॰ every module takes THIS branch and none reaches `:3332`.
                ॰ A SHARED NUMBER WAS REFUSED for the reason २७ and २८ give against
                ॰ sharing: the two addresses are not the same lowering. `:3332` forms
                ॰ the address from `आधारफलम्` scaled by the element width, on a base
                ॰ the growth routine never touched; here the base has just been
                ॰ REALLOCATED and the address is formed from the reloaded pointer.
                ॰ Counting both under ३२ would put a growth count under a name that
                ॰ means the other branch, and the census could never separate them
                ॰ again — the one reading this table exists to make impossible.
                रचितगणनम् ३५ ।
            इति अन्यथा आदि
                स्थानमात्रम् भवति सत्यम् ।
                सूचीस्थानफलम् भवति अभिव्यञ्जकरचना वाक्यम् ॱ वामसूचकाङ्क ।
                स्थानमात्रम् भवति असत्यम् ।
            इति
            ॰ `W-len` — THIS ARM WRITES IN PLACE, BY DESIGN, AND THE INTERPRETER
            ॰ DOES NOT. An indexed store into an octet run there is COPY-ON-
            ॰ WRITE: it takes `o.as_slice().to_vec()`, writes the octet, and
            ॰ stores a FRESH run back through the base, because a byte run is a
            ॰ VALUE and mutating one would write through every alias of it.
            ॰
            ॰ THE TWO AGREE UNLESS AN ALIAS EXISTS — a slice taken from a run
            ॰ BEFORE a store into that run. Through such an alias the
            ॰ interpreter sees the old octets and the compiled program sees the
            ॰ new ones. Nobody has measured whether the corpus ever does that,
            ॰ so this is a KNOWN divergence and not a measured one; it is
            ॰ written here so that whoever finds it finds it already named,
            ॰ rather than spending the evening deciding which half is wrong.
            ॰
            ॰ It matters at this arm in particular because the run-length
            ॰ header is bumped on the same path: a header write and an element
            ॰ write sit together here and both are in-place.
            यदि सूचीस्थानफलम् ॱ क्रमाङ्क अधिकम् ० आदि
                ॰ A NARROW STORE, AND ITS WIDTH IS READ AND NEVER ASSUMED. The
                ॰ one-octet case landed 2026-09-13 because a word store here
                ॰ clobbered seven neighbours; `अ१६` and `अ३२` clobbered SIX and
                ॰ THREE and were left on the word store for another two weeks,
                ॰ because the `अ३२` fixture wrote its two elements in ASCENDING
                ॰ order and the second write repaired what the first ate.
                ॰
                ॰ THIS LADDER IS THE SAME THREE-WAY LADDER `सङ्कीर्णनिधानरचना`
                ॰ RUNS, deliberately: that routine answers ० and emits NOTHING
                ॰ for a width it does not name, so a width admitted here and
                ॰ refused there would DROP the store rather than widen it. They
                ॰ are written the same way so that a fourth width added to one
                ॰ is visibly absent from the other.
                ॰
                ॰ WIDTH ८ FALLS THROUGH, and that is the whole word store below,
                ॰ unchanged. WIDTH ० CANNOT REACH HERE — this block is inside
