॰ Declaration::Function; here the declarations are व्याकर ॱ घोषणाकोश,
॰ 1-based, and the count is what कार्यक्रमपठनम् returned.
॰
॰ Faithful to ir.rs including its own admission: the SymbolId is ०, with
॰ Rust's comment "In a real flow, we'd lookup the SymbolId from the
॰ resolver. For now, we simulate a SymbolId." अर्थ is that resolver and is
॰ D-002c; when it lands this line is one lookup, not a redesign.
॰
॰ This line said विश्लेषण when it was written, and that was not a typo —
॰ it was the only conclusion the tree supported. `vishlesana.t1` HELD THE
॰ WRONG MODULE: `tools/port_encode.py` had put the sema's Resolver/Scope/
॰ TypeKind under the disassembler's filename, and not one of the
॰ disassembler's eight symbols was in it. Doc 03 §2 names the sema अर्थ and
॰ spec/marks.tsv names विश्लेषणम् the disassembler. A second reader drew the
॰ same wrong conclusion from the same file before it was caught.
