            ॰ current_block.terminator = Some(Terminator::Return(ret_val)).
            ॰ THE BLOCK IN HAND when the body ends is the one that returns: the
            ॰ entry when the body had no यदि or यावत्, the last join or exit
            ॰ block otherwise — `W-198`; and since `W-245`, for a body that ends
            ॰ in `प्रत्यागमनम्`, the EMPTY block that statement opened after
            ॰ itself, closed here with a Return of nothing.
            चरः विरामः ॱॱ अवसान भवति अवसानरचना आरभ्य प्रत्यागमनावसानभेद ऽ फलम् ऽ पर्वाङ्कनम् ० समाप्तम् ।
            चरः अवगणनसमाप्ति ॱॱ न६४ भवति पर्वसमाप्तिः विरामः ।

            ॰ blocks: the run प्रवेश..अग्रिमपर्वाङ्क. Every id numbered since the
            ॰ entry belongs to this function and has been closed by now — see
            ॰ "the block in hand" above — so the run is dense and in id order.
            चरः पर्वसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ भवति आरभ्य आरभ्य अग्रिमपर्वाङ्क वियोगः प्रवेश ॱ क्रमाङ्क समाप्तम् योगः १ समाप्तम् ।
            ॰ self.functions.push(Function { name: SymbolId(0), blocks, entry_block })
            चरः अवगणनद्वि ॱॱ न६४ भवति वृत्तियोजनम् आरभ्य ० ऽ प्रवेश ॱ क्रमाङ्क ऽ पर्वसंख्यान ऽ प्रवेश समाप्तम् ।
            ॰ `W-237`: the declaration's name token beside the routine, for the
            ॰ census's labels — see the side tables at the head.
            वृत्तिनामचिह्नककोश अङ्कः अवगणनद्वि अन्तः भवति घोषणा ॱ नामसूचकाङ्क ।

            ॰ A REFUSED CALL REFUSES THE PROGRAM — `W-204`, the resolver's
            ॰ shape: `कार्यक्रमनिर्णयः` answers असत्यम् at the first name it
            ॰ cannot place, and this answers ० — "no function built" — at the
            ॰ first call whose callee has no symbol, and stops. What was
            ॰ appended before the refusal stays in the arenas, as the
            ॰ resolver's partial scopes do; the answer, not the arena, says
            ॰ whether the build is usable, and a reader tests the answer (or
            ॰ अनिर्णीताह्वानमस्ति) before reading the arenas.
            यदि अनिर्णीताह्वानमस्ति समम् सत्यम् आदि
                प्रत्यागमनम् ० ।
            इति
        इति

        सूचकाङ्क भवति सूचकाङ्क योगः १ ।
    इति

    ॰ The module's growth routine, once, if any site called it.
